aria\u2019s mom gave **each person 3 more balloons**.\n\nSo the number of balloons given by her mom is:\n\n$$\n5\\ \\text{people} \\times 3\\ \\text{balloons} = 15\\ \\text{balloons}\n$$\n\n---\n\n### Step 4: Total number of balloons\n\nNow, add the balloons given before and after:\n\n$$\n9\\ \\text{balloons (initial)} + 15\\ \\text{balloons (from mom)} = 24\\ \\text{balloons}\n$$\n\n---\n\n### \u2705 Final Answer:\n\n$$\n\\boxed{24}\n$$", "decode_seconds": 9.145371680147946, "draft_calls": 0, "event": "benchmark_row", "input_tokens": 95, "method": "native_ar", "output_hash": "a5c5937632324f62671cc440ad2000f52133b9ce8005588fe5f05d9f9f1a0ff4", "output_tokens": 352, "peak_allocated_memory_bytes": 20522316288, "peak_reserved_memory_bytes": 20837302272, "problem_id": "gsm8k/13d10b8bfcf30de5", "profile_regions_ms": {"unattributed_runtime": 9179.771143943071}, "rank": 0, "reference_answer": "24", "repetition": 0, "request_seconds": 9.179771143943071, "reserved_memory_after_bytes": 20837302272, "reserved_memory_before_bytes": 20837302272, "sampling_seed": 521260812837726876, "sampling_temperature": 1.0, "target_calls": 352, "time_to_first_token_seconds": 0.033010761719197035, "turn_index": 0}
